### =================================================================
### "馋了么" 后端API 全功能集成测试 (v4 - Final)
### 
### 测试流程:
### 1. 认证模块: 注册并登录三个角色，获取tokens。
### 2. 菜品管理 (商家): 验证菜品的增、删、改、查。
### 3. 核心订单流: 顾客下单 -> 商家接单 -> 骑手抢单。
### 4. 订单状态流转 (商家/骑手): 验证商家和骑手对订单状态的后续操作。
### 5. 多状态订单查询: 验证各角色获取不同状态订单列表的功能。
### 6. 个人信息管理: 验证所有角色获取和修改个人信息的功能。
### =================================================================

# --- 全局变量定义 ---
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@merchant_token = 
@customer_token = 
@rider_token = 

@restaurant_id = 1
@new_order_id = 
@new_menu_item_id = 


#################################################################
# 阶段 1: 认证 (Authentication)
# (使用已有用户登录，跳过注册，加快测试)
#################################################################

### (1.1) 商家注册 (专用接口)
# @name merchantRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": {
        "username": "laoban_03",
        "password": "password_laoban_03",
        "email": "laoban03@test.com",
        "phone_number": "18800000023",
        "full_name": "老板三号",
        "user_type": "restaurant_admin"
    },
    "restaurant": {
        "restaurant_name": "老板三号的麻薯摊",
        "description": "香甜四溢",
        "address": "虚拟美食街203号",
        "phone_number": "010-33335555",
        "opening_hours": "19:00-04:00"
    }
}

### (1.1) 商家登录 (wangwu_admin)
# @name merchantLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "laoban_02",
    "password": "password_laoban_02"
}

###
@merchant_token = {{merchantLogin.response.body.token}}


### (1.2) 顾客注册 (通用接口)
# @name customerRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "xiaolin",
    "password": "password_xiaolin",
    "email": "xiaolin@test.com",
    "phone_number": "18800000033",
    "full_name": "肖林",
    "user_type": "customer"
}

### (1.2) 顾客登录 (wuming)
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "xiaohong",
    "password": "password_xiaohong"
}

###
@customer_token = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### (1.5) 骑手注册 (通用接口)
# @name riderRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "qishou_bawang",
    "password": "password_qishou_bawang",
    "email": "bawang@test.com",
    "phone_number": "18800000043",
    "full_name": "骑手霸王",
    "user_type": "courier"
}

### (1.3) 骑手登录 (qishou_feimao)
# @name riderLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "qishou_shandian",
    "password": "password_qishou_shandian"
}

###
@rider_token = {{riderLogin.response.body.token}}


#################################################################
# 阶段 4.1: 商家 - 菜品管理 (CRUD)
#################################################################

### (4.1.1) [商家] 创建新菜品
# @name createMenuItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "item_name": "招牌秘制烤鱼",
    "description": "外酥里嫩，麻辣鲜香，本店特色。",
    "price": 88.00,
    "category": "特色招牌",
    "image_url": "http://example.com/items/kaoyu.jpg",
    "is_available": true
}

### (4.1.1) [商家] 创建新菜品
# @name createMenuItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "item_name": "流汁烤苕皮",
    "description": "内有丰富小菜，超级好吃",
    "price": 88.00,
    "category": "烧烤",
    "image_url": "http://example.com/items/kaoyu.jpg",
    "is_available": true
}

###
# 捕获新菜品的ID
@new_menu_item_id = {{createMenuItem.response.body.item_id}}

### (4.1.2) [商家] 获取菜品列表
# 验证新创建的烤鱼是否在列表中
GET {{baseUrl}}/menu-items
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}

### (4.1.3) [商家] 更新菜品信息
# 将烤鱼的价格和可售状态修改
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/menu-items/{{new_menu_item_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "price": 8.00,
    "is_available": false
}

### (4.1.4) [商家] 删除菜品
# 删除刚刚创建和修改的烤鱼
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/menu-items/{{new_menu_item_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}


#################################################################
# 阶段 2 & 3: 核心订单流与实时事件
#################################################################

### (2.3) [顾客] 下单
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 4,
    "deliveryAddress": "新天元一号，放前台",
    "items": [
        { "itemId": 8, "quantity": 1 },
        { "itemId": 9, "quantity": 2 }
    ],
    "notes": "多放辣，谢谢！"
}

###
@new_order_id = {{createOrder.response.body.order.order_id}}
# >> 验证点: 后端控制台应打印 "Emitting event 'new_order'..."


### (2.4) [商家] 确认接单 ('placed' -> 'restaurant_confirmed')
# @name confirmOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}
# >> 验证点: 后端控制台应打印 'order_status_update' 和 'new_available_order' 事件


#################################################################
# 阶段 4.2: 商家/骑手 - 订单状态流转与分类查询
#################################################################

### (4.2.1) [商家] 查看“进行中”订单列表
# 验证刚刚接的单是否在这里
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/restaurant/in-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}

### (4.2.2) [商家] 更新状态: 开始制作 ('restaurant_confirmed' -> 'preparing')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "preparing"
}
# >> 验证点: 后端控制台应打印 'order_status_update' 事件给顾客

### (4.2.3) [商家] 更新状态: 餐品备好 ('preparing' -> 'ready_for_pickup')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "ready_for_pickup"
}
# >> 验证点: 后端控制台应打印 'order_status_update' 给顾客，并 'broadcast' 'new_available_order' 给骑手

### (4.2.4) [骑手] 查看订单广场
# 验证刚刚备好的订单是否出现在这里
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/rider/available
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}

### (4.2.5) [骑手] 接单 ('ready_for_pickup' -> 'out_for_delivery')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}
# >> 验证点: 后端控制台应打印两条 'order_status_update' (给顾客和商家)

### (4.2.6) [骑手] 查看“配送中”任务列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/rider/in-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}

### (4.2.7) [骑手] 确认送达 ('out_for_delivery' -> 'delivered')
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/deliver
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}
# >> 验证点: 后端控制台应打印两条 'order_status_update' (给顾客和商家)

### (4.2.8) [商家] 查看“历史”订单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/restaurant/history
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}

### (4.2.9) [骑手] 查看“历史”任务列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/rider/history
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}


#################################################################
# 阶段 4.3: 用户/商家/骑手 - 个人信息管理
#################################################################

### (4.3.1) [通用] 获取个人资料
# 更换下面的 token 可以测试不同角色的情况
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}

### (4.3.2) [通用] 修改个人资料
# 比如顾客修改自己的姓名和默认地址
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "full_name": "吃货小红(改名)",
    "default_address": "地球村一号"
}

### (4.3.3) [通用] 修改密码
# 假设旧密码是 '$2b$10$uRT5hVEon5jRggCAurr1puQBNjmsBPbQQmhV4eJIaZpK2qp8PLNsy' 对应的明文
# 注意：你需要知道一个用户的真实明文密码才能测试成功
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "oldPassword": "password_xiaohong",
    "newPassword": "password_xiaohongnew"
}